member.summary:
POST /api/team-calendars
Creates a new calendar.
Body: { "name": "My Team" }

PUT /api/team-calendars/{id}
Renames a calendar.
Body: { "name": "New Name" }

PUT /api/team-calendars/{id}/members
Replaces all members with a new set.
Body: { "memberUserIds": [1, 2, 3] }

